  "details": "Currently, after you \"merge\" your temporary Steam/Oculus account with the official VRChat account, your old account remains in the game, and appears in user searches etc..\nIt leaves newer players confused when they're searching for their friends, when they see 2 accounts with that name (just one with additional characters).\nAdditionally, friend requests should be moved to new user id, just like accepted friends themselves are. Currently, if you send a friend request to someone on your temporary account A and then merge it with official B, then that someone accepting that request will befriend them to A instead of B. Such relation will be completely useless.\nSame with various other data like blocking others/being blocked if it's not being moved already.",
